<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>工作模块 · 个人系统</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        :root {
            --bg-page: #F7F8FA;
            --bg-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
            --bg-sidebar: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            --bg-topbar: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            --border-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            --border-subtle: rgba(15,23,42,0.07);
            --text-primary: #0F172A;
            --text-secondary: #64748B;
            --text-muted: #94A3B8;
            --shadow-card: 0 4px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);
            --shadow-card-hover: 0 8px 32px rgba(15,23,42,0.10);
            --blur-card: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
            --blob-opacity: 0.38;
            --blob-blur: 120px;

            --a-work-1: #FDA4AF; --a-work-2: #FECDD3; --a-work-3: #FBCFE8;
            --s-work: #E11D48;

            --m1: var(--a-work-1);
            --m2: var(--a-work-2);
            --m3: var(--a-work-3);
            --m-main: var(--s-work);
        }

        .dark {
            --bg-page: #0A0F1C;
            --bg-card: rgba(30,41,59,0.5);
            --bg-sidebar: rgba(15,23,42,0.78);
            --bg-topbar: rgba(15,23,42,0.78);
            --border-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            --border-subtle: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --text-primary: #F1F5F9;
            --text-secondary: #94A3B8;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --shadow-card: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            --shadow-card-hover: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            --blur-card: blur(28px) saturate(160%);
            --blob-opacity: 0.24;
            --blob-blur: 140px;

            --a-work-1: #BE123C; --a-work-2: #9F1239; --a-work-3: #881337;
            --s-work: #FB7185;
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background: var(--bg-page);
            transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .aurora-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
        .blob {
            position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(var(--blob-blur));
            opacity: var(--blob-opacity);
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease, filter 0.5s ease, background 0.5s ease;
            animation: drift 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }
        .blob-1 { width: 520px; height: 520px; top: -8%;  left: -8%;  background: var(--m1); }
        .blob-2 { width: 480px; height: 480px; top: 24%;  right: -10%; background: var(--m2); animation-delay: -7s; }
        .blob-3 { width: 560px; height: 560px; bottom: -16%; left: 30%; background: var(--m3); animation-delay: -14s; }

        @keyframes drift {
            from { transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); }
            to   { transform: translate(36px,-28px) scale(1.08); }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .blob { animation: none; } }

        .app {
            position: relative; z-index: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: 56px 1fr;
            grid-template-areas: "sidebar topbar" "sidebar main";
            height: 100vh;
        }

        .sidebar {
            grid-area: sidebar;
            background: var(--bg-sidebar);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 16px 12px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .sidebar-title {
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 14px 12px 6px;
        }
        .menu-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer; border-left: 3px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.18s ease; user-select: none;
        }
        .menu-item:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-primary); }
        .menu-item.active {
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 12%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            border-left-color: var(--m-main);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .menu-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--m-main); flex-shrink: 0; }

        .topbar {
            grid-area: topbar;
            background: var(--bg-topbar);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px; gap: 16px;
        }
        .breadcrumb { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .breadcrumb strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; }
        .topbar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

        .btn {
            border: none; border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.18s ease;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--m-main); color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 30%, transparent);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 45%, transparent);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--m-main); color: var(--m-main); }
        /* 小号按钮：书架的「+ 新建项目」用（这一族按钮是本次随书架一起加的，
           其余 7 份原型没有它 —— 所以要落在 work 的模块增量里，不能抬成共用内核）。 */
        .btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
        .theme-toggle {
            width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }
        .theme-toggle:hover { transform: scale(1.05); border-color: var(--m-main); }

        .main {
            grid-area: main;
            padding: 24px; overflow-y: auto;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;
        }

        .tabs {
            display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 6px; border-radius: 14px;
        }
        .tab {
            padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .tab:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: var(--border-subtle); }
        .tab.active {
            background: var(--m-main); color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 30%, transparent);
        }

        .panel { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
        .panel.active { display: flex; }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            padding: 20px;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .card-title {
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        }

        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }

        .stat { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .stat-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); }

        .hero { padding: 24px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .hero::before {
            content: ""; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -10%;
            width: 280px; height: 280px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--m-main); opacity: 0.10;
            filter: blur(60px);
        }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 700; }
        .hero p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; }
        .hero-meta { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .hero-meta strong { color: var(--text-primary); }

        .task-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .task-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .task-check {
            width: 18px; height: 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
            flex-shrink: 0; cursor: pointer;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px; color: #fff;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }
        .task-check.done { background: var(--m-main); border-color: var(--m-main); }
        .task-text { flex: 1; cursor: pointer; }
        .task-text.done { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .task-tag {
            font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--border-subtle);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .meeting-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .meeting-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .meeting-time {
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--m-main);
            min-width: 60px;
        }
        .meeting-info { flex: 1; }
        .meeting-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
        .meeting-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

        .okr-item { margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .okr-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .okr-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .okr-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 6px;
            background: var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%; border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--m-main); opacity: 0.8;
            transition: width 0.4s ease;
        }
        .progress-label {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .doc-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }
        .doc-item:hover { border-color: var(--m-main); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .doc-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .doc-icon {
            width: 32px; height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 14%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .doc-info { flex: 1; }
        .doc-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
        .doc-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .contact-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .avatar {
            width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 14%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .contact-info { flex: 1; }
        .contact-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
        .contact-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .timesheet-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .timesheet-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .timesheet-value { font-weight: 600; color: var(--m-main); }

        .review-block { margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .review-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .review-label {
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .review-list {
            list-style: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .review-list li::before {
            content: "·";
            color: var(--m-main);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        /* 客户资料 */
        .client-card {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }
        .client-card:hover { border-color: var(--m-main); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .client-card:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

        .client-avatar {
            width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 16%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .client-info { flex: 1; }
        .client-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .client-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .client-tags { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .client-tag {
            font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 12%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
        }
        .client-right { text-align: right; }
        .client-amount {
            font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--m-main);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .client-status { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* 服务器 */
        .server-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .server-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .server-env {
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 14%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            min-width: 44px; text-align: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .server-info { flex: 1; }
        .server-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
        .server-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }
        .server-status {
            font-size: 11px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(16,185,129,0.14);
            color: #059669;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .dark .server-status { color: #6EE7B7; }

        /* 部署 */
        .deploy-status {
            font-size: 11px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .deploy-status.success { background: rgba(16,185,129,0.14); color: #059669; }
        .deploy-status.rollback { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.14); color: #D97706; }
        .dark .deploy-status.success { color: #6EE7B7; }
        .dark .deploy-status.rollback { color: #FCD34D; }

        /* 弹窗 */
        .modal-mask {
            position: fixed; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(15,23,42,0.35);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            z-index: 100;
            display: none;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .modal-mask.open { display: flex; }

        .modal {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(15,23,42,0.25);
            width: 100%; max-width: 640px;
            max-height: 88vh;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .modal-head {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .modal-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
        .modal-close {
            width: 32px; height: 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }
        .modal-close:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-primary); }

        .modal-body { padding: 22px; overflow-y: auto; }

        .detail-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .detail-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .detail-label {
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .detail-row {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .detail-row span:first-child { color: var(--text-muted); }
        .detail-row span:last-child { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 500; }

        .detail-list {
            list-style: none; font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.9;
        }
        .detail-list li::before {
            content: "·";
            color: var(--m-main);
            font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px;
        }

        .recipe-hero {
            height: 140px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 18%, transparent);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-actions {
            display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .notice {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           项目书架（工作模块 · 「项目」分区）
           ------------------------------------------------------------
           · 这一族是本文件里**唯一**由「设计稿直接落进来」的样式，
             不是从别的模块拷贝来的 —— 所以它只会进 work 的模块增量
             （build-workspace-css.mjs 的 CORE_THRESHOLD 判定）。
           · **行为不在这里**：飞入/飞出、弹窗内容只有一处实现 ——
             `src/components/workspace/work/ProjectShelf.tsx`。
             同一件事写两处必然分叉（同一个坑在 AI 助手的阶段计时上踩过）。
             这里保留 `.fly-clone` / `.modal.entering|leaving` 是因为
             **CSS 的唯一事实源是本文件**，样式归这里、时机归组件。
           ============================================================ */

        .bookshelf-wrap {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .bookshelf-head {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .shelf-group { margin-bottom: 26px; }
        .shelf-group:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .shelf-group-title {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .shelf-group-title::after {
            content: ""; flex: 1;
            height: 1px; background: var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .shelf-count {
            font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0;
            text-transform: none;
        }
        .grid-shelf {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        /* 精装书封面 */
        .book-flat {
            position: relative;
            aspect-ratio: 5 / 7;
            border-radius: 3px 7px 7px 3px;
            cursor: pointer;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1);
            transform-origin: center bottom;
            user-select: none;
            box-shadow:
                0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.08),
                0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.06),
                0 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05),
                0 4px 10px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);
        }
        /* 布纹：45° 细斜线。压在封面上但对交互透明（z-index 3 + pointer-events:none）。 */
        .book-flat::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 0px,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.035) 1px,
                    transparent 1px,
                    transparent 3px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 3;
            border-radius: inherit;
        }
        .book-flat:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-1.2deg) scale(1.015);
            box-shadow:
                0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1),
                0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.08),
                0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.06),
                0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.05),
                0 20px 40px rgba(15,23,42,0.25);
        }
        .dark .book-flat:hover {
            box-shadow:
                0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3),
                0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25),
                0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2),
                0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15),
                0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);
        }
        /* 已归档：降饱和 + 略暗。悬停时部分复原 —— 归档不等于不可读。 */
        .book-flat.archived {
            filter: saturate(0.5) brightness(0.9);
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
        .book-flat.archived:hover {
            filter: saturate(0.75) brightness(1);
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .bf-cover {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            color: #fff;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 书脊与折痕 —— 两片假光影，让平面矩形读成一本合上的书 */
        .bf-spine {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0;
            width: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.42) 0%,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 40%,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 70%,
                transparent 100%);
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .bf-spine::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 3px; top: 8%; bottom: 8%;
            width: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 25%,
                rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 75%,
                transparent 100%);
        }
        .bf-flap {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 14px;
            width: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 0%,
                rgba(255,255,255,0.12) 50%,
                transparent 100%);
            z-index: 2;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .bf-flap::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%,
                transparent 100%);
            box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
        }

        /* 封面内框。四支样式对应应用里的 `Project.priority` 三档
           （高=双线 core / 中=单线 bi / 低=虚线 perf；fe 备着未用，与 `.prio-P3` 同理）。 */
        .bf-frame {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 14px 12px 14px 22px;
            padding: 12px 12px 10px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            z-index: 4;
        }
        .bf-frame.frame-core { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }
        .bf-frame.frame-core::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 3px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .bf-frame.frame-fe { border: 1.5px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
        .bf-frame.frame-bi { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22); }
        .bf-frame.frame-perf { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

        .bf-tag-row {
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: auto;
        }
        .bf-tag {
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            border-radius: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .bf-icon {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.75;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
        }

        .bf-title-block {
            margin-bottom: auto;
            padding-top: 6px;
        }
        .bf-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.3;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #F5E8D0;
            text-shadow:
                0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4),
                0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
                0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4),
                0 0 12px rgba(255,215,150,0.2);
        }
        .bf-divider {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .bf-divider::before,
        .bf-divider::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
        }
        .bf-divider span {
            width: 4px; height: 4px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .bf-subtitle {
            font-size: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .bf-publisher {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            font-size: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding-top: 8px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }
        .bf-progress-mini {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
        }
        .bf-progress-mini-bar {
            width: 32px; height: 2px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 999px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .bf-progress-mini-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            border-radius: 999px;
            display: block;
        }
        .bf-progress-mini-text {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        }

        /* 书签：由 `Project.daysLeft` 决定 —— 已逾期红、30 天内金、其余不挂。
           这是封面上唯一的"时间压力"信号，所以它的判据写在数据那一侧。 */
        .bf-bookmark {
            position: absolute;
            top: -3px;
            right: 20px;
            width: 12px;
            height: 26px;
            z-index: 5;
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 50% 78%, 0 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .bf-bookmark.gold {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFE78A 0%, #F5C842 45%, #C9A02E 100%);
        }
        .bf-bookmark.red {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FF6B6B 0%, #EF4444 45%, #A01F1F 100%);
        }

        /* 飞行克隆体：书 → 弹窗（以及关闭时的反向）。position:fixed + 只改
           left/top/width/height/opacity/border-radius，四条位移属性共用一条
           缓动曲线 —— 没有这条 transition，克隆体会"瞬移"而不是"飞"。 */
        .fly-clone {
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 400;
            pointer-events: none;
            border-radius: 3px 7px 7px 3px;
            overflow: hidden;
            will-change: transform, opacity;
            transition: none;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(15,23,42,0.4);
        }
        .fly-clone.animating {
            transition:
                left 0.48s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                top 0.48s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                width 0.48s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                height 0.48s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                opacity 0.4s ease,
                border-radius 0.4s ease;
        }
        .dark .fly-clone {
            box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        }

        /* 弹窗进出场。基础规则（.modal-mask / .modal / …）在「弹窗」那一节，
           这里只补两帧动画与标题上的色点。 */
        .modal.entering {
            animation: modalIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.4,0.64,1) 0.18s both;
        }
        .modal.leaving {
            animation: modalOut 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) both;
        }
        @keyframes modalIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.92) translateY(12px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
        }
        @keyframes modalOut {
            from { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
            to { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.94) translateY(8px); }
        }
        /* 标题前的项目色点。颜色由组件内联给（background 与 color 同值），
           外圈用 currentColor 取淡 —— 一处改色、两处跟着变。 */
        .modal-title-dot {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 10px; height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-right: 10px;
            vertical-align: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);
        }

        /* 空态（书架分组为空、关联文档为空时用） */
        .empty-state {
            text-align: center; padding: 24px;
            color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* 标签胶囊（弹窗里的标签行） */
        .tag-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 12%, transparent);
            color: var(--m-main);
            margin-right: 6px;
        }

        /* 可点行（弹窗里跳去关联对象） */
        .link-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--border-subtle);
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .link-row:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 12%, transparent); color: var(--m-main); }
        .link-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .link-row .link-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); }
        .link-row:hover .link-arrow { color: var(--m-main); }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text-muted); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-areas: "topbar" "main"; }
            .sidebar { display: none; }
        }
        /* 书架在窄屏收一档 —— 单独一个 @media 而不是并进上面那条：
           并进去会让**整条壳的窄屏规则**从共用内核掉进 work 的增量（7 个模块各留一份副本）。 */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid-shelf { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="aurora-bg">
    <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
    <div class="blob blob-2"></div>
    <div class="blob blob-3"></div>
</div>

<div class="app">

    <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-title">全局层</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>工作台</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>任务清单</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>日程</div>

        <div class="sidebar-title">领域层</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>生活</div>
        <div class="menu-item active"><span class="menu-dot"></span>工作</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>学习</div>

        <div class="sidebar-title">执行层</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>项目</div>

        <div class="sidebar-title">沉淀层</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>知识库</div>

        <div class="sidebar-title">支撑层</div>
        <div class="menu-item"><span class="menu-dot"></span>设置</div>
    </aside>

    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="breadcrumb">工作 / <strong>工作台</strong></div>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="quickAdd">+ 快速记录</button>
            <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle">🌙</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main">

        <nav class="tabs" id="tabs">
            <div class="tab active" data-tab="dashboard">工作台</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="tasks">任务</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="projects">项目</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="servers">服务器</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="deploy">部署</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="calendar">日历会议</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="docs">文档索引</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="contacts">联系人</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="clients">客户资料</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="okr">OKR/KPI</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="timesheet">工时</div>
            <div class="tab" data-tab="review">周报复盘</div>
        </nav>

        <!-- 工作台 -->
        <div class="panel active" data-panel="dashboard">
            <section class="card hero">
                <h1>下午好，杨刘 👋</h1>
                <p>今天是 2026-09-20 星期日，本周还有 1 天。</p>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <span>今日任务：<strong>3 / 8</strong></span>
                    <span>今日会议：<strong>2 场</strong></span>
                    <span>进行项目：<strong>4 个</strong></span>
                    <span>本周工时：<strong>32h</strong></span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="grid-3">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">今日任务</div>
                    <div class="stat">3 / 8</div>
                    <div class="stat-desc">2 个高优先级 · 1 个逾期</div>
                    <div class="progress-bar" style="margin-top:8px;"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 38%"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">今日会议</div>
                    <div class="stat">2</div>
                    <div class="stat-desc">下一场 14:00 项目评审</div>
                    <div class="progress-bar" style="margin-top:8px;"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 40%"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">本周工时</div>
                    <div class="stat">32h</div>
                    <div class="stat-desc">目标 40h · 80%</div>
                    <div class="progress-bar" style="margin-top:8px;"><div class="progress-fill" style="width: 80%"></div></div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">今日任务</div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="task-check done">✓</div>
                        <div class="task-text done">修复登录页样式</div>
                        <span class="task-tag">已完成</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="task-check done">✓</div>
                        <div class="task-text done">代码评审</div>
                        <span class="task-tag">已完成</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="task-check done">✓</div>
                        <div class="task-text done">写日报</div>
                        <span class="task-tag">已完成</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="task-check"></div>
                        <div class="task-text">准备项目评审</div>
                        <span class="task-tag">进行中</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="task-item">
                        <div class="task-check"></div>
                        <div class="task-text">更新接口文档</div>
                        <span class="task-tag">待办</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">今日会议</div>
                    <div class="meeting-item">
                        <div class="meeting-time">10:00</div>
                        <div class="meeting-info">
                            <div class="meeting-title">每日站会</div>
                            <div class="meeting-meta">30 分钟 · 线上</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="meeting-item">
                        <div class="meeting-time">14:00</div>
                        <div class="meeting-info">
                            <div class="meeting-title">项目评审</div>
                            <div class="meeting-meta">60 分钟 · 会议室 A</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">进行中项目</div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📦</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">支付系统重构</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">进度 62% · 截止 10-31</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📦</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">用户中心改版</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">进度 38% · 截止 11-15</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📦</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">数据看板</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">进度 80% · 截止 09-30</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">最近文档</div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📄</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">支付系统重构方案</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">更新于昨天</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📘</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">接口设计规范</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">更新于 3 天前</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="doc-item">
                        <div class="doc-icon">📝</div>
                        <div class="doc-info">
                            <div class="doc-name">周会纪要 09-18</div>
                            <div class="doc-meta">更新于 2 天前</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- 任务 -->
        <div class="panel" data-panel="tasks">
            <section class="card">
                <div class="card-title">工作任务</div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check done">✓</div>
                    <div class="task-text done">修复登录页样式</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">已完成</span>
                </div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check done">✓</div>
                    <div class="task-text done">代码评审</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">已完成</span>
                </div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check"></div>
                    <div class="task-text">准备项目评审</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">进行中</span>
                </div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check"></div>
                    <div class="task-text">更新接口文档</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">待办</span>
                </div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check"></div>
                    <div class="task-text">优化首页加载速度</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">待办</span>
                </div>
                <div class="task-item">
                    <div class="task-check"></div>
                    <div class="task-text">排查线上告警</div>
                    <span class="task-tag">待办</span>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- 项目：书架视图
             ⚠️ 这一块的内容是**设计样本**（4 本，刻意覆盖两种分组、两种书框、金书签与已归档降饱和）。
                应用里这本书架由**真实项目数据**渲染 —— 口径是 `scope=work`
                （见 docs/模块设计.md §2「工作项目 = 调用项目模块，scope=work」），
                渲染在 `src/components/workspace/work/ProjectShelf.tsx`。
                所以这里出现"支付系统重构"这类名字是原型自己的样本，不是应用的数据源。 -->
        <div class="panel" data-panel="projects">
            <div class="bookshelf-wrap">
                <div class="bookshelf-head">
                    <div>
                        <div class="card-title" style="margin:0;">我的书架</div>
                        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px;">
                            4 个项目 · 3 进行中 · 1 已归档 · 点击书查看详情
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="alert('原型演示：新建项目')">+ 新建项目</button>
                </div>

                <div class="shelf-group">
                    <div class="shelf-group-title">
                        进行中
                        <span class="shelf-count">3 本</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid-shelf">
                        <div class="book-flat" data-name="支付系统重构" data-progress="62" data-deadline="2026-10-31" data-tone="#C13A4E">
                            <div class="bf-cover" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #C13A4E 0%, #8B1A2B 45%, #7F0E1F 100%);">
                                <div class="bf-spine"></div>
                                <div class="bf-flap"></div>
                                <div class="bf-frame frame-core">
